  "body": "LOT-168\nRefs #286 (categories 1, 2 and 10 done; the 4 others wait on the capture #929)\nClaim: cloud/lot-168-sonnet\n\n**Problem.** The home page lists only some sub-forums (Programmation 13 of 27 with the injections, Overclocking 6 of 7).\n\n**Cause.** Legacy has the same gap; REST `subcategories/` (LOT-057, `R285a`-`R285c`) has them all, but nothing merged it with the page.\n\n**Change.**\n- `ForumListCompletion` + `RESTBrowsingClient.completingSubforums(of:)`: the page's links, paths and order stay; REST rows with no page link (matched by title) are added as REST `subcat` links in REST order. A failed category keeps the page's list; cancellation/offline/timeout throw.\n- `SubforumInjection` checked against the capture: « PDA » and « Biblio Links » are not in REST, removed. The other categories' entries are not captured: #929.\n- Spec `docs/lots/LOT-168-forum-list-completeness.md` (with limits), LOT-021 deviation 12, HFR-PROTOCOL note. No app wiring.\n\n**Tests.** `ForumListCompletionTests` (REST counts 15/7/27 per captured category, order, injections vs capture, client requests and failures); the oracle test undoes the table change as a named deviation. Two mutations each failed a named test. `swift test`: 2027 pass; swiftlint --strict clean on the touched files.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_014QH2CFppTY6evnXe65TDDK\n",
